      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-tech-cryo-blast",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You fire a cryogenic burst from your omni-tool that flash-freezes targets in a wide area, slowing their movements.</p><p>All creatures in a @Template[burst|distance:10]{10-foot radius burst} within <strong>30 feet</strong> must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-tech-cryo-blast] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[cold]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(2*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[cold]] damage and is <strong>Slowed 1</strong> until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(4*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[cold]] damage and is <strong>Immobilized</strong> until the end of its next turn. If the target is already Slowed, it is Immobilized instead.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
